Sun sets and night battle begins --- Foes mistake each other in darkness --- Rākṣasas glow and devour monkeys --- Monkeys maul horses elephants and chariots --- Rāma Lakṣmaṇa mow down rākṣasas with arrows --- Rāma wounds six leaders and clears quarters --- Blood rivers flow as Trikūṭa echoes roars --- Aṅgada wrecks chariot while Indrajit turns invisible and shoots unseen